# Staging dir left behind if third_party/setup-onnxruntime.sh is killed
# before its EXIT trap fires.
cpp/third_party/.ort-extract.*

# ONNX Runtime SDK: the release tarball is committed for reproducibility; the
# extracted tree (third_party/onnxruntime/, incl. the platform-specific .so/.dll
# in lib/) is generated automatically — by `cmake` configure (auto-extract) or by
# third_party/setup-onnxruntime.sh — and is not tracked. Override the SDK
# location entirely with the ONNXRUNTIME_DIR env var.
cpp/third_party/onnxruntime/
